{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13765","headline":"李湖州孺人弹筝歌 · 顾况","name":"李湖州孺人弹筝歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"武帝昇天留法曲，凄清掩仰弦柱促。\n上阳宫人怨青苔，此夜想夫怜碧玉。\n思妇高楼刺壁窥，愁猿呌月鹦呼儿。\n寸心十指有长短，妙入神处无人知。\n独把梁州凡几拍，风沙对面胡秦隔。\n听中忘却前溪碧，醉後犹疑边草白。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾况","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13765.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13765","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}